    "title": "Temporal 驱动的长任务运行与调度",
    "subtitle": "AgentFlow 以 StreamTask 锁定业务快照，以 Temporal History 恢复编排；审批等待不占用 API 内存",
    "output": "docs/visualizations/temporal-long-task-scheduling.html",
